      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to the Credential Scoping page ([[pages/credential-scoping]]), the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** immediately before that process starts.\n\nSpecifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent (or Query agent) child process\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is **never** mutated and never holds the key\n\nThis approach ensures that a compromised or misbehaving Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting environment variables, since the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually makes the Anthropic API calls.",
